  "description": "IP Intelligence and IP geolocation for .NET and C#. Finds an IP address's likely location (country, region, town, and coordinates), connection type, and network, reading a data file on your server. Network details include the Autonomous System Number (ASN). This package is the on-premise engine for the 51Degrees Pipeline API. An alternative to MaxMind and IPinfo.",
